**Why the full text is here and not only in vendor/**: md4c's terms ask for the
permission notice in "all copies or substantial portions of the Software", and a
compiled `litedoc4` contains md4c. Anyone who redistributes a built litedoc4 is
distributing md4c with it, and the notice has to travel in something that goes
with the binary rather than in a file beside sources the binary left behind.
MD4Lean below has been in this form from the start.

